{"type":"standard","title":"Don Davis (North Carolina politician)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Don Davis (North Carolina politician)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q5294403","titles":{"canonical":"Don_Davis_(North_Carolina_politician)","normalized":"Don Davis (North Carolina politician)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Don Davis (North Carolina politician)</span></span>"},"pageid":7567185,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Portrait_of_Congressman_Don_Davis.jpg/330px-Portrait_of_Congressman_Don_Davis.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/Portrait_of_Congressman_Don_Davis.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375958153","tid":"5c4eec5f-b56b-11f1-9897-9ebe2b580acd","timestamp":"2026-09-21T03:20:14Z","description":"American politician (born 1971)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Don_Davis_(North_Carolina_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Don_Davis_(North_Carolina_politician)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Don_Davis_(North_Carolina_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Don_Davis_(North_Carolina_politician)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Don_Davis_(North_Carolina_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Don_Davis_(North_Carolina_politician)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Don_Davis_(North_Carolina_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Don_Davis_(North_Carolina_politician)"}},"extract":"Donald Gene Davis is an American politician and former Air Force officer serving as the United States representative for North Carolina's 1st congressional district since 2023. A member of the Democratic Party, he previously served in the North Carolina Senate, representing the 5th district from 2009 to 2011 and again from 2013 to 2023.","extract_html":"<p><b>Donald Gene Davis</b> is an American politician and former Air Force officer serving as the United States representative for North Carolina's 1st congressional district since 2023. A member of the Democratic Party, he previously served in the North Carolina Senate, representing the 5th district from 2009 to 2011 and again from 2013 to 2023.</p>"}